  "description": "Let's Get Free is the debut studio album by hip-hop duo dead prez. It was released on February 8, 2000, on Loud Records and Columbia Records. The album is mainly produced by dead prez, along with additional production from Lord Jamar of Brand Nubian, Hedrush, and Kanye West. The album is supported by its five singles: \"Police State\", \"Hip-Hop\", \"It's Bigger Than Hip-Hop\", \"I'm a African\", and \"Mind Sex\". The album peaked at number 73 on the U.S. Billboard 200 and number 22 on the U.S. Top R&B/Hip-Hop Albums chart.",
